msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A-⟪k:1⟫Aspetta!⟪k:2⟫N-⟪k:3⟫Non ho la più pallida idea di cosa dovrei fare..."

#: scenario6:scenario6_DC709350_7D43_4641_94B4_BD278118B4B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef445f9e90ef6907c20de7b08590550df0d8fc7154b33c85edf6f222aaa71917
