msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DC709350_7D43_4641_94B4_BD278118B4B0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do the same thing you have been doing—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫be a maid.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Convince the house’s "
"guests that this is a wonderful place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Fai la stessa cosa di sempre—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫sii una domestica.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Convinci gli ospiti della "
"casa che questo è un posto magnifico."

#: scenario6:scenario6_7F6217C6_D418_4F30_BA21_F95C9C9613D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f81a39bc4da2769284596ce8248289620dc78894f09e52419fbf3ad18b7d50bf
#. default-sha256: 3d928879a60081b058c83b713ec1b6a886d40ab259ff48160c9e232ec0478f71
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_7F6217C6_D418_4F30_BA21_F95C9C9613D5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Make them enjoy their stay."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Fai in modo che si godano il loro soggiorno."

#: scenario6:scenario6_70266F3D_E042_48CB_AB84_325DB04F15EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcf1218dc6f4405ccabec1803395e128322b9d6b87482f747f703bd666383914
