#: scenario6:scenario6_2BA96708_D781_43B5_984B_CAB87143E16E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c6a7f60dade12b9c8d62ca63145c0ca28301943d2a1c7b836142c0c43297b95
