msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Servant? ⟪k:1⟫Can’t say I remember asking for a ⟪k:2⟫lady⟪k:3⟫ servant,⟪k:4⟫but eh, I "
"suppose these things do happen.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Doesn’t much matter who they sent."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Una serva? ⟪k:1⟫Non ricordo d’aver chiesto un servo ⟪k:2⟫donna⟪k:3⟫,⟪k:4⟫ma... ⟪k:5⟫beh, "
"suppongo siano cose che accadono.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Non importa granché chi mi mandano."

