msgid "⟪k:0⟫Name’s Hayden Rhodes.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Just a retired old man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il mio nome è Hayden Rhodes.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sono soltanto un anziano in pensione."

#: scenario6:scenario6_6B306684_03CA_4561_988F_3664EF244BC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
