msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As I am sure you have already guessed, this man was the Rhodes siblings’ "
"grandfather."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Come avrai già capito, quell’uomo era il nonno dei fratelli Rhodes."

#: scenario6:scenario6_A8FE49B6_A49E_4789_A3D0_472E211B2CDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 882de0e29b6e8d47069cdee8d6e66153912a1629fb363bc97401340b42c21e17
