msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_A8FE49B6_A49E_4789_A3D0_472E211B2CDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was a single chef, a physician, a servant to take care of all the cleaning, and then "
"me, who served as his personal assistant."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’era un singolo cuoco, un medico, un addetto alle pulizie,⟪k:1⟫e poi c’ero io, che gli "
"facevo da assistente personale."

#: scenario6:scenario6_2544CC8E_7C46_4D70_B2BC_2F88E3822C84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfb3e1fa10859cc9aa67f591d4dd58acc957c01313acde139e8f95c392669310
