msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2544CC8E_7C46_4D70_B2BC_2F88E3822C84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whenever he got the chance, Hayden would chase me down and make me practice proper "
"etiquette. ⟪k:1⟫According to him, I had much to learn."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ogni volta che ne aveva la possibilità, Hayden mi correva dietro per insegnarmi la giusta "
"condotta. ⟪k:1⟫Secondo lui, avevo molto da imparare."

#: scenario6:scenario6_FA58DE31_3AD9_4F63_8ABD_916D2B254600
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c3285a38bb928e3c23816e9042d7ec8125000105229a36100d4798888ba2c78
