msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Thicker than bloody molasses!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Now, I have no interest in sticking my nose "
"into your business, asking where you hail from,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hah! Sei più densa della dannata melassa!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ora, io non ho alcun interesse "
"a ficcare il naso nei tuoi affari, chiedendoti da dove provieni,"

#: scenario6:scenario6_A55137D8_0BBB_48F7_A78D_EFB332EF34D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0699afeeb70f16d45125623e781744e47eefb742a4b2ba2d1354d3cbe2fe366
