msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You must always act with elegance and grace.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You must always maintain your "
"composure,⟪k:3⟫even if the house is falling down around you.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Whatever happens, you deal "
"with it quickly and quietly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Devi comportarti sempre con grazia ed eleganza.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Devi sempre mantenere la "
"compostezza,⟪k:3⟫anche qualora la casa ti stia crollando addosso.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Qualunque cosa accada, "
"la affronti velocemente e con discrezione."

