"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Bloody hell, you are ⟪k:3⟫not⟪k:4⟫ going to make this easy, are you?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"Whose idea was it that a country bumpkin would make a good servant?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I’d like to give him "
"a piece of my mind."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dannazione, non ce la fai proprio a rendermi le cose semplici, eh?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A chi "
"è venuto in mente che una campagnola potesse essere una buona serva?⟪k:5⟫ Mi piacerebbe dirgliene "
"quattro."

